MC2_gt8Uq8Ls2FvajcZ8HzM5WvD1RY-m5mYhVrvHUGjA&oe=6ACCF944"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sub-zabo9WUQ7kNvwEn3roj&_nc_oc=AdpSb8f-si52CO3IAdqCP3bGA4lpeWw-ssKmnBkO9YGFT0z37fDrYDWU8vv_Lsw1_6U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMUx99TYLNxFE79rL9_xkY9HtpK1MoLu2Zirz-sxGGNZg&oe=6ACD1622"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8F2qVGXjIc8Q7kNvwH52lGg&_nc_oc=AdoEaU_xbZhZ4NoZ5d8Mj56x13jntBbY_shUbx5cihvXzC9u9hFxjFdOhbW9ERkdtIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPqRaHE1aEvA1BR6mosAKQEtUgAsFxdSOPScJrWFVa3Eg&oe=6ACD0033"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r6RGmlq3zzcQ7kNvwEq5SVu&_nc_oc=AdqoOOaZRN1XiEElfcYzhmleyAKw6DYd2Gk3mYMcVC1Az2Xg2_1U3O9eJJGgv-cH6cM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO3CSAZHrFzd4tFmxfkKCXDAQGhVsctXiSkfRr2s2J4hg&oe=6ACCFF2F"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q3clvNHtzocQ7kNvwFUBRQf&_nc_oc=Adpp4Wxs1t8QsDh9nIYlfzx70aQxOi8EdGq7CWh2IayoubBQ-i1fs5gHNQh6hU00Nf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPFQ4UYEbMAYV4C1Oid_XseLiegK8lMBYFQXCJYFIRkyQ&oe=6ACCFB25"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-Z9abiq98bwQ7kNvwFIa2wN&_nc_oc=AdpHEIXEC32HeJHrRttj8n6IN_xRWZtjuJTZJJtsbEGvGuNnKr0UJf5bUBz5G5sMXQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNDDZ0xWDS9-ocA5Gw-1s8gUBnaTXx737pEz1KQ9Ws1Og&oe=6ACCFA0D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4Miye65zFQUQ7kNvwGDqVmG&_nc_oc=AdpJDB89PfiGZZguA869RqMMUoa1FmeXK8dLWDX_ufvO5nw9LGiNJq0_b6bteYpykG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=